01:42.337 --> 01:43.377
Why?!

01:43.647 --> 01:45.627
Why, why?!

01:45.627 --> 01:47.007
Why?!

01:49.067 --> 01:51.297
Let's go, Scorpius!

02:02.847 --> 02:04.597
What's the matter, Scorpius?

02:04.597 --> 02:06.437
Surely this isn't the best you can do.

02:15.817 --> 02:17.777
<i>I ate her poison attack, huh?</i>

02:18.587 --> 02:22.127
<i>Yet with my heaven arts, 
countering it is easy.</i>

02:23.327 --> 02:25.897
Good. A nice attack.

02:25.897 --> 02:27.787
We'll increase the speed a bit more.

02:29.367 --> 02:31.837
Alchemize, Winter of Swords!

03:10.537 --> 03:13.707
Now, what will you show me next?

03:13.707 --> 03:16.027
Surely you haven't just been

03:16.027 --> 03:19.137
feeding flights of fancy
all these years?!

03:22.467 --> 03:24.207
We're finally having our reunion!

03:24.207 --> 03:26.347
Entertain us more!

03:27.207 --> 03:29.507
<i>No, wait, calm down!</i>

03:29.507 --> 03:31.527
<i>I'm acting like a blood-crazed maniac!</i>

03:32.157 --> 03:34.677
<i>What's the point if I lose sight 
of my goal in this battle?</i>

03:35.087 --> 03:38.247
<i>Right now my priority is 
getting Scorpius to behave.</i>

03:39.957 --> 03:42.067
<i>Did Lufas take over?</i>

03:43.137 --> 03:45.707
<i>What is she doing, enjoying battle?</i>

03:46.427 --> 03:47.707
Do you really...

03:47.937 --> 03:51.127
believe that's your limit?

03:52.367 --> 03:55.757
<i>I'm starting to understand what 
the Devil King meant before.</i>

03:56.617 --> 04:00.797
<i>I'm what's weakening Lufas the most.</i>

04:02.947 --> 04:05.347
<i>That's fine for now though.</i>

04:05.347 --> 04:10.797
Why, why, why, <i>why</i>?!

04:05.777 --> 04:07.727
<i>Our goal isn't to kill her.</i>

04:10.977 --> 04:12.017
<i>We see.</i>

04:13.667 --> 04:15.377
<i>So now we're really getting started.</i>

04:16.737 --> 04:19.157
Is that your true form?

04:21.807 --> 04:23.617
<b>Emperor Berserk Scorpion</b>

04:21.807 --> 04:23.617
<b>Scorpius's Form After Releasing Anthropomorphism/Disaster-Class Monster</b>

04:33.167 --> 04:35.257
<i>What incredible power!</i>

04:39.057 --> 04:42.097
<i>Is her bonus from the 
goddess still rising?</i>

04:43.847 --> 04:45.047
<i>I see.</i>

04:45.427 --> 04:48.627
<i>So she gets stronger the more time passes.</i>

04:49.027 --> 04:51.097
<i>That's common in stories.</i>

04:51.697 --> 04:54.027
<i>A protagonist who's 
weaker than their enemy</i>

04:54.027 --> 04:56.797
<i>suddenly gets stronger from the 
power of their bonds</i>

04:56.797 --> 04:58.357
<i>to pull off a comeback.</i>

04:58.797 --> 05:01.457
<i>People call that a deus ex machina.</i>

05:02.337 --> 05:04.927
<i>Which means that right now,</i>

05:04.927 --> 05:07.357
<i>Scorpius is benefiting from that</i>

05:07.357 --> 05:09.517
<i>to obtain absurd strength.</i>

05:10.627 --> 05:11.477
<i>In which case,</i>

05:11.477 --> 05:13.297
<i>what I need to do is simple.</i>

05:14.257 --> 05:17.667
<i>I need to crush them before 
they grow even stronger!</i>

05:18.297 --> 05:19.777
<i>This is going to hurt a bit.</i>

05:20.177 --> 05:22.817
You can take it, Scorpius.

05:44.157 --> 05:45.037
Meteor Kick!

06:02.377 --> 06:04.007
Huh?!

06:13.227 --> 06:14.877
No!

06:22.857 --> 06:28.117
Fighting and ensuring our opponent's
HP doesn't hit zero is not easy.

06:31.537 --> 06:36.057
Dina, thank you very much
for protecting me.

06:36.057 --> 06:39.337
Not at all, it's my job as an advisor.

06:42.077 --> 06:43.437
Lady Lufas?!

06:43.437 --> 06:45.257
It's not over yet.

06:45.557 --> 06:49.697
Knocking Scorpius out isn't 
enough to finish her now.

06:50.477 --> 06:52.607
We need a way to break the 
goddess's mental influence.

06:52.607 --> 06:55.177
Lady Lufas! Y-You're choking me!

06:53.097 --> 06:54.747
The key to which

06:55.467 --> 06:57.187
is you, Dina.

06:57.727 --> 06:58.517
Huh?!

07:00.087 --> 07:03.367
<b>Blutgang, First District</b>

07:05.097 --> 07:07.567
This district is mostly cleaned up now.

07:07.567 --> 07:10.957
Yes. Let us continue to remain vigilant.

07:12.867 --> 07:16.667
Hey, what do you think of 
how Lady Lufas is now?

07:17.457 --> 07:21.597
I feel like she's grown much 
kinder compared to in the past.

07:21.597 --> 07:25.637
Yes. She is starting to consider 
showing mercy to her foes.

07:25.637 --> 07:30.847
However, she is still the 
master we love and respect.

07:31.207 --> 07:33.767
I imagine you would know better,

07:33.767 --> 07:37.087
but Sir Mizar informed me that Master

07:37.087 --> 07:38.857
was not always a ruthless person.

07:39.707 --> 07:43.217
By my estimate, Master became ruthless

07:43.217 --> 07:46.127
and merciless out of necessity.

07:46.127 --> 07:48.747
She was originally a gentle person.

07:49.057 --> 07:50.177
True.

07:50.177 --> 07:54.537
Lady Lufas was strict in the past,
but she wasn't merciless.

07:54.907 --> 07:59.317
Otherwise, I would have been 
killed when we first met.

08:00.017 --> 08:02.507
But that makes me wonder...

08:03.457 --> 08:08.247
Maybe Lady Lufas would be happier 
if she didn't regain her memories?

08:08.837 --> 08:11.057
Do you not want them to return?

08:11.057 --> 08:12.717
I <i>do</i> want her to regain them!

08:14.767 --> 08:16.117
I can't believe that she's forgotten

08:16.557 --> 08:19.607
the time we all spent together, 
even if only partially.

08:20.537 --> 08:22.177
I couldn't bear it.

08:23.627 --> 08:28.307
However, I also don't like 
seeing Lady Lufas suffering.

08:30.687 --> 08:32.117
In any case,

08:32.117 --> 08:34.247
the one who holds the 
key is mostly likely

08:34.247 --> 08:35.667
Lady Dina.

08:35.667 --> 08:39.747
That woman's actions 
are far too unnatural.

08:40.167 --> 08:41.667
Really? You think so?

08:41.667 --> 08:43.627
Have you not noticed it?

08:45.767 --> 08:50.347
That is also likely due to the 
goddess's mental influence.

08:52.667 --> 08:54.007
As a golem,

08:54.007 --> 08:57.577
I am immune to mental 
control and domination.

08:58.147 --> 09:00.577
Therefore, I predict the
following worst-case scenario:

09:01.317 --> 09:04.297
everyone else has already had their 
memories manipulated by Lady Dina,

09:04.297 --> 09:07.687
or otherwise placed 
under mental influence.

09:11.737 --> 09:17.727
You must never let your guard down 
around that lady, no, that woman.

09:22.717 --> 09:24.467
Karkinos mentioned it,

09:24.797 --> 09:29.397
but Scorpius is currently 
under the goddess's control,

09:29.397 --> 09:31.847
just like the Seven Heroes 
were two hundred years ago.

09:32.337 --> 09:33.847
From what we can tell,

09:34.097 --> 09:37.627
her negative emotions in particular are 
being amplified to an absurd degree.

09:38.847 --> 09:42.437
Perhaps its not worth referring
to it as mental influence,

09:42.947 --> 09:45.547
but she's under something 
like that from the goddess.

09:46.527 --> 09:49.067
That's where you come in.

09:49.067 --> 09:52.807
You mentioned before that, in 
addition to memory manipulations,

09:53.407 --> 09:55.497
you were also capable of
mental influence.

09:56.177 --> 10:00.207
Dina, if that is the same 
skill the goddess is using,

10:00.207 --> 10:03.867
then shouldn't you be able to undo the 
goddess's mental manipulation as well?

10:10.277 --> 10:13.517
I think I can do it, but...

10:14.267 --> 10:16.287
I can take a look.

10:18.927 --> 10:20.587
Yeah, okay.

10:21.057 --> 10:26.147
Her desire to monopolize you,
Lady Lufas, has been forcibly increased.

10:26.657 --> 10:29.867
Normally, she's the safe kind of yandere

10:29.867 --> 10:32.367
who would never attack the 
one she's interested in.

10:32.847 --> 10:35.467
There are never any safe yandere though...

10:36.347 --> 10:37.527
<i>I knew it.</i>

10:37.527 --> 10:40.497
<i>Dina also possesses the same 
skill that the goddess has.</i>

10:42.917 --> 10:44.747
<i>The same skill as the goddess?</i>

10:45.497 --> 10:49.137
<i>Her element for attacks is 
also the same as the goddess.</i>

10:49.877 --> 10:54.067
<i>Maybe Dina and the goddess are 
somehow secretly connected?</i>

10:54.857 --> 10:57.517
<i>The timing of this incident 
is far too suspicious as well.</i>

10:57.887 --> 11:00.707
<i>The Seven Heroes and the Twelve 
Heavenly Stars have been conveniently</i>

11:00.707 --> 11:02.147
<i>showing up where Dina guides us to.</i>

11:02.717 --> 11:04.897
<i>I never paid it much mind</i>

11:04.897 --> 11:07.107
<i>since I've ultimately benefited each time.</i>

11:07.427 --> 11:11.297
<i>Yet she's also aware of both our 
movements and those of the devilfolk.</i>

11:12.147 --> 11:13.317
<i>The more I think about it now,</i>

11:13.717 --> 11:15.487
<i>the more I wonder if she's been</i>

11:15.907 --> 11:19.107
<i>using mental influence 
to control each side,</i>

11:20.247 --> 11:22.267
<i>just like the goddess has.</i>

11:26.717 --> 11:30.077
I should be able to undo the effects.

11:30.387 --> 11:31.987
However, Lady Lufas?

11:33.217 --> 11:38.597
Won't doing this get me labeled as 
an enemy of the goddess as well?

11:38.817 --> 11:40.417
That is a possibility.

11:41.917 --> 11:46.947
Hey! That's where you say,
"We'll protect you,"

11:46.947 --> 11:49.567
even if it's just a lie!

11:49.567 --> 11:51.107
Don't worry.

11:51.107 --> 11:52.737
We will protect you.

11:52.737 --> 11:53.707
In monotone?!

11:55.247 --> 11:57.217
Hmph! Fine, then!

11:57.217 --> 11:59.077
I'll incur the goddess's wrath,

11:59.077 --> 12:02.097
and die sad and alone in the end!

12:03.177 --> 12:05.787
Poor, pitiful me!

12:05.787 --> 12:07.397
Very well, very well.

12:07.397 --> 12:11.097
We will protect you, so please 
do something about Scorpius.

12:11.097 --> 12:12.177
It's a promise!

12:12.177 --> 12:13.547
A promise, you hear?!

12:16.077 --> 12:19.077
<i>Apparently Dina fears the goddess.</i>

12:19.077 --> 12:21.997
<i>Yet is that really how she truly feels?</i>

12:22.907 --> 12:25.797
<i>She's said that she's a player like me,</i>

12:26.117 --> 12:28.347
<i>but is that really the truth?</i>

12:29.937 --> 12:33.027
<i>No, there's likely something more to it.</i>

12:33.537 --> 12:35.027
Please be careful.

12:35.027 --> 12:38.107
The goddess never acts herself.

12:38.107 --> 12:41.677
However, she will create an avatar 
that she can move freely in

12:41.677 --> 12:43.787
and incite others.

12:45.187 --> 12:49.047
<i>It's all well and good if Dina really 
does get labeled an enemy by the goddess,</i>

12:49.877 --> 12:50.747
<i>but...</i>

12:51.207 --> 12:54.717
<i>isn't the worst-case scenario
the possibility that</i>

12:54.717 --> 12:56.447
<i>she's the avatar of the goddess?</i>

12:56.447 --> 12:58.967
Alright, I'll free her now.

13:13.587 --> 13:15.647
<b>Blutgang, Third District</b>

13:16.047 --> 13:18.617
<b>Devilfolk - Seven Luminary</b>

13:16.047 --> 13:18.617
<b>Luna, the Moon</b>

13:18.937 --> 13:20.347
Mars was defeated,

13:20.347 --> 13:21.827
and Jupiter's been defeated too.

13:22.487 --> 13:25.037
We can't afford any more mistakes.

13:25.847 --> 13:30.637
My disgrace will reflect directly 
on him, becoming his disgrace.

13:33.357 --> 13:34.387
Lord Terra...

13:35.297 --> 13:37.047
<b>The Devil King's Castle</b>

13:37.337 --> 13:39.957
Don't get reckless
trying to play the hero.

13:40.317 --> 13:42.037
You're a woman.

13:42.037 --> 13:44.157
Please don't underestimate me,
Lord Terra!

13:44.157 --> 13:45.387
I'm one of the Seven Luminaries!

13:45.387 --> 13:46.687
Don't be so conceited.

13:47.187 --> 13:49.877
The Seven Luminaries are 
just provisional commanders.

13:51.277 --> 13:54.437
It's no guarantee that you all are strong.

13:55.037 --> 13:56.947
So you don't need to push yourself.

13:57.397 --> 13:59.687
Focus on your covert actions 
and sowing confusion.

14:05.077 --> 14:06.557
My, my...

14:07.287 --> 14:09.457
Poor Luna...

14:11.707 --> 14:15.927
At this rate, you'll never 
be able to stand beside him.

14:16.247 --> 14:18.157
If you want him to acknowledge you,

14:18.157 --> 14:21.337
then you'll have to achieve 
something greater.

14:22.837 --> 14:24.377
Something greater?

14:27.287 --> 14:28.497
For example...

14:29.687 --> 14:33.897
Earning the glory of taking down Blutgang.

14:36.377 --> 14:39.017
<i>I can do more than just covert activities!</i>

14:39.397 --> 14:41.817
Please don't underestimate me, Lord Terra.

14:45.147 --> 14:46.637
You dodged that?

14:46.637 --> 14:48.077
Poor thing.

14:48.077 --> 14:50.687
If you just went unconscious 
while unaware,

14:50.687 --> 14:52.917
you wouldn't have to suffer fear.

14:54.207 --> 14:55.797
Y-You!

14:56.077 --> 14:57.627
Aigokeros!

14:58.257 --> 14:59.517
Luna.

14:59.517 --> 15:01.267
Weak one,

15:01.587 --> 15:04.257
I shall grant you two choices.

15:04.477 --> 15:06.977
One is sweet surrender.

15:07.467 --> 15:10.757
If you don't resist,
then I'll make an offering of you

15:10.757 --> 15:14.727
to my great master without harming you.

15:14.727 --> 15:17.767
You're asking me to let Lufas 
Maphaahl kill me without protest?

15:17.767 --> 15:18.817
Exactly.

15:19.537 --> 15:23.427
One such as you, who is as 
insignificant as a worm,

15:23.867 --> 15:27.057
will gain the right to 
die at my master's hands.

15:27.447 --> 15:28.687
It would be

15:29.037 --> 15:30.637
an honor.

15:32.667 --> 15:35.537
<i>Your other option is pitiful subjugation.</i>

15:35.937 --> 15:37.887
<i>I'll rip your limbs from your body</i>

15:37.887 --> 15:41.397
<i>and present you to my master 
as a bloody sacrifice.</i>

15:41.397 --> 15:43.007
Both are the same in the end!

15:43.007 --> 15:44.477
<i>Indeed!</i>

15:44.787 --> 15:47.937
<i>Now choose, weak one!</i>

15:47.937 --> 15:50.677
<i>Surrender and die,</i>

15:51.377 --> 15:53.647
<i>or resist and die a miserable death!</i>

15:54.047 --> 15:58.817
I can't afford to place Lord 
Terra in even worse standing...

16:02.037 --> 16:03.737
I reject both!

16:10.057 --> 16:12.017
<i>How slow.</i>

16:12.017 --> 16:13.687
<i>How feeble.</i>

16:13.687 --> 16:15.997
<i>How </i>weak<i>.</i>

16:19.537 --> 16:22.507
<i>You're finished, Seven Luminary, Luna!</i>

16:22.507 --> 16:26.217
<i>You foolish, poisonous bug who 
dares to defy my great king!</i>

16:26.927 --> 16:30.057
<i>Now, what shall we do with you?!</i>

16:30.057 --> 16:32.677
<i>Shall I tear off your limbs?!</i>

16:33.357 --> 16:37.297
<i>Shall I gouge out your entrails 
while you still live?!</i>

16:37.297 --> 16:39.137
Lord Terra...

16:39.517 --> 16:41.287
<i>Fool!</i>

16:41.287 --> 16:46.947
<i>Did you believe a false demon stood a 
chance against a true demon like me?!</i>

16:46.947 --> 16:48.737
Y-You're calling me fake?!

16:48.737 --> 16:50.657
Indeed.

16:50.657 --> 16:52.967
<i>You are nothing more than
toys for the goddess.</i>

16:53.747 --> 16:57.417
<i>You are imitations created 
to resemble demons!</i>

16:57.417 --> 17:01.017
<i>Have you never questioned it?</i>

17:01.017 --> 17:05.287
<i>Did you never wonder why devilfolk don't 
leave corpses behind when they die?</i>

17:05.847 --> 17:09.637
That's because we dissolve 
into mana when we die...

17:09.917 --> 17:12.497
<i>Yet why do you dissolve into mana?!</i>

17:12.897 --> 17:17.577
<i>Even we monsters leave corpses that 
return to the earth upon their death.</i>

17:18.067 --> 17:24.127
<i>So why do only devilfolk vanish 
as if they never existed?</i>

17:26.457 --> 17:31.027
<i>Do you honestly have no 
recollection of that?</i>

17:31.277 --> 17:34.747
<i>Have you not witnessed it so 
much that it leaves you sick?!</i>

17:35.987 --> 17:37.337
No way...!

17:37.337 --> 17:38.827
<i>That's right.</i>

17:38.827 --> 17:42.877
<i>What you devilfolk truly are is...</i>

17:44.857 --> 17:45.637
<i>Wha?!</i>

17:49.387 --> 17:50.747
<i>You!</i>

17:51.427 --> 17:52.597
I see.

17:52.597 --> 17:56.797
So that huge form is 
constructed with mana?

17:56.797 --> 18:01.107
<i>Terra, son of the Devil King, Orm!</i>

17:59.827 --> 18:01.107
<b>Terra</b>

17:59.827 --> 18:01.107
<b>Son of the Devil King Who Organized the Seven Luminaries</b>

18:01.357 --> 18:03.327
L-Lord Terra!

18:04.067 --> 18:07.087
How many times did I tell 
you not to push yourself?

18:08.327 --> 18:09.987
My apologies.

18:10.487 --> 18:12.447
Don't make me worry about you so much.

18:13.807 --> 18:15.787
I'm really glad I made it in time.

18:18.227 --> 18:20.507
<i>Hmph. This is good timing.</i>

18:20.507 --> 18:24.417
<i>I'll offer you as a sacrifice 
to my master as well!</i>

18:26.007 --> 18:27.507
Aigokeros!

18:27.737 --> 18:31.967
I am seething at you for 
betraying the devilfolk

18:32.227 --> 18:34.337
and wounding my subordinates.

18:35.277 --> 18:37.677
However, now is not the 
time for me to face you.

18:38.307 --> 18:39.767
We'll be withdrawing.

18:40.237 --> 18:41.977
<i>You think you can flee?</i>

18:42.447 --> 18:43.937
I do.

18:46.147 --> 18:46.817
<i>Wha?!</i>

18:57.607 --> 18:58.677
<i>Black wings...</i>

18:59.277 --> 19:01.167
<i>That's Lufas Maphaahl?</i>

19:01.697 --> 19:03.127
<i>She's still that strong</i>

19:03.127 --> 19:05.857
<i>with over half of her 
strength shaved down?</i>

19:08.447 --> 19:09.097
Luna.

19:09.097 --> 19:10.317
Y-Yes!

19:10.657 --> 19:12.217
Right now the Seven Luminaries,

19:12.217 --> 19:16.557
no, all the devilfolk are being 
manipulated by someone else.

19:17.017 --> 19:19.787
My father knows this, and 
instead of trying to stop them,

19:19.787 --> 19:22.687
he seems to be oddly 
cooperative with them.

19:23.927 --> 19:29.717
Right now you are one of the few who 
I can trust within the devilfolk.

19:31.137 --> 19:34.647
Please do not waste your life 
on a battlefield such as this.

19:36.117 --> 19:39.157
I need you.

19:39.407 --> 19:41.327
L-Lord Terra.

19:46.557 --> 19:49.017
<i>What's going on with that hottie?</i>

19:49.017 --> 19:52.777
<i>He was princess carrying what 
looked like a devilfolk woman.</i>

19:52.777 --> 19:53.877
Lady Lufas,

19:54.507 --> 19:57.787
I've completely freed her from 
the goddess's mental influence.

19:57.787 --> 19:59.557
She'll be alright now.

19:59.557 --> 20:01.577
She should wake up soon.

20:01.577 --> 20:03.727
Good. Good work.

20:04.187 --> 20:07.007
So, did you see that 
handsome man flying by?

20:07.007 --> 20:08.437
Oh, yes.

20:08.897 --> 20:10.987
Who was that man?

20:11.297 --> 20:12.797
His name is Terra.

20:12.797 --> 20:15.007
He's the Devil King's son.

20:15.407 --> 20:18.477
<i>So handsome princes do exist, huh?</i>

20:19.357 --> 20:20.857
<i>That's odd, though.</i>

20:21.227 --> 20:22.237
<i>Devilfolk are a race</i>

20:22.237 --> 20:25.707
<i>with blue skin and the whites and 
blacks of their eyes inverted.</i>

20:26.627 --> 20:29.077
<i>Yet he was different.</i>

20:29.447 --> 20:32.837
<i>He also didn't resemble 
the Devil King at all.</i>

20:33.357 --> 20:37.157
He would definitely be a romance 
option in an otome game!

20:37.157 --> 20:39.227
We never played any, so we wouldn't know.

20:40.017 --> 20:42.217
You know, I've thought this before,

20:42.217 --> 20:45.807
but you really aren't very 
feminine, Lady Lufas.

20:45.807 --> 20:48.577
Well, that's because we're a guy inside.

20:51.547 --> 20:53.197
Huh? Uhh...

20:54.037 --> 20:55.487
Did we never tell you?

20:55.777 --> 20:57.227
No, you <i>didn't</i>!

20:57.227 --> 20:58.747
This is my first time hearing it!

20:58.747 --> 21:00.757
Now that you mention it,
we suppose we never mentioned it.

21:00.757 --> 21:02.117
Well, not to worry.

21:02.117 --> 21:02.947
Hmm?

21:03.237 --> 21:06.907
All my sexual desire left me 
when I came into this body,

21:06.907 --> 21:09.557
and it still has yet to return.

21:09.557 --> 21:13.867
So I don't feel anything 
from seeing a woman's body.

21:14.167 --> 21:16.497
That's kind of frustrating in its own way!

21:18.047 --> 21:18.837
Hmm?

21:20.097 --> 21:21.907
Golems resembling Libra?

21:24.257 --> 21:25.987
Comparing data...

21:25.987 --> 21:27.177
Match found.

21:27.177 --> 21:29.757
You are Lady Lufas Maphaahl, correct?

21:29.757 --> 21:31.547
Yes, we are.

21:34.577 --> 21:37.437
We have long awaited your arrival.

21:37.437 --> 21:40.777
Please come visit the 
royal area of Blutgang.

21:41.287 --> 21:43.487
Our master is waiting for you.

21:43.487 --> 21:44.847
Your master?

21:45.157 --> 21:47.247
You mean the king of Blutgang?

21:47.517 --> 21:51.127
No. Someone you are very familiar with.

21:51.887 --> 21:54.207
Our very own creator,

21:55.457 --> 21:58.437
the Blacksmith King, Mizar.

22:00.247 --> 22:01.007
<i>Huh?</i>

22:01.377 --> 22:02.387
<i>No way?!</i>

22:02.847 --> 22:03.997
<i>Mizar?!</i>

22:04.407 --> 22:06.477
<i>He's still alive?!</i>

22:12.877 --> 22:17.547
